# Presenter notes are private and live outside this repository on purpose.
# These patterns are a second line of defence in case a copy is ever dropped in
# here by accident. The real protection is that the file lives somewhere else.
*Presenter-Notes*
*presenter-notes*
*speaker-notes*
*.notes.html

# Print exports are generated from the source, not tracked
*.pdf

# OS and editor cruft
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
